    "expectedRule": "Mirror Cycle City tracks a real/mirror phase with three phase mirrors (first_phase_mirror, second_phase_mirror, third_phase_mirror). Clearing a phase mirror opens a pending phase choice that blocks departure (镜城相位尚未指定，请先选择现实或镜像。) until the player resolves law/resolve-mirror-city-phase; choosing the other phase costs 10% of max HP (5% with phaseweaveMantle), logged 镜城相位·现实/镜像：支付最大生命 10%（N 点），相位选择已落定。, while keeping the current phase costs nothing (相位保持不变). A switching choice is unavailable when current HP is not above the cost (当前生命不足以支付相位切换代价。) and resolving without a pending choice is rejected 当前没有待指定的镜城相位。. Real phase grants outgoing force +12% and art -6% (art 0% with parallaxVisor); mirror phase inverts this. real_anchor lights anchors.real only while in real phase; mirror_anchor lights anchors.mirror only while in mirror phase; lighting the wrong phase leaves the anchor dark. Route gates: mirror_city_real_relic_phase_lane opens only in real phase, mirror_city_mirror_relic_phase_lane only in mirror phase, mirror_city_real_anchor_survey_lane needs the real anchor, mirror_city_mirror_anchor_recharge_lane needs the mirror anchor, mirror_city_dual_anchor_survey_lane needs both anchors, and the four nameless_reflection approaches need all three phase choices (完成三处相位抉择后，镜王门才会显形。); closed gates remove the edge from legal adjacent targets so run/move through them is rejected illegal-move. Starting the nameless_reflection boss combat snapshots the lit anchors into bossAnchorSnapshot and mints totalShells = max(0, 2 - anchoredPhaseCount - homecomingPrism) mirror shells (2 with no anchors, 1 with one anchor); the display shows 现实相位，镜壳 R/T. Each damaging hit against the boss while shells remain consumes one shell, halves the final damage (min 1) and logs 镜壳抵消本次攻势，最终伤害减半，剩余 N 枚。; after the snapshot phase choices can no longer be specified. Display severity is danger while a phase choice is pending or at least 2 shells remain, warning with one shell or unresolved mirrors, resolved only when both anchors are lit or the boss has started. Law state persists through a save-codec round-trip. Re-selecting a cleared phase mirror is rejected already-resolved without changing law state or HP. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
